{"4536740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes", "steam_appid": 4536740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a first-person psychological horror experience where every choice matters. Confront the Echoes of a forgotten past and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror.</strong> The darkness hides Echoes of the past. As you explore, the environment itself tells a story, fragments of memories, whispers, and unsettling details that hint at what happened before. Stay alert, pay attention to your surroundings, and be prepared to confront the unexpected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/9e904a10694bb290a01f9ff40d104625.poster.avif?t=1781004851\" aria-label=\"Enemy searching for the player.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/9e904a10694bb290a01f9ff40d104625.webm?t=1781004851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/9e904a10694bb290a01f9ff40d104625.mp4?t=1781004851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisions &amp; Consequences.</strong> Your choices define your story. You can simply push forward and solve the puzzles… Or explore deeper, uncover hidden dialogues, and discover objects that may unlock multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/0010110da63e7ce0bceb13f1039bc0de.avif?t=1781004851\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras_big/0010110da63e7ce0bceb13f1039bc0de.webp?t=1781004851 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling &amp; Puzzles. </strong>The truth is not told. it’s discovered. Explore your surroundings, connect subtle clues, and interpret symbols scattered across the environment. Markings, notes, light patterns, and forgotten details will help you reconstruct the Echoes and uncover what really happened.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/c17cbb90a7889676471286f8f9d5161d.avif?t=1781004851\" alt=\"Shadow sitting on a sofa in the forest.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras_big/c17cbb90a7889676471286f8f9d5161d.webp?t=1781004851 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Experience with Professional Voice Acting.</strong> A dark, emotive, and atmospheric story set around a cursed route, where mysterious Echoes brought to life by professional voice actors communicate with you. Every interaction reveals a fragment of the truth. Feel the tension, despair, and danger through powerful performances that react to your choices and immerse you completely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/90ab9282d3a76655a6594fd643f777f4.poster.avif?t=1781004851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/90ab9282d3a76655a6594fd643f777f4.webm?t=1781004851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/90ab9282d3a76655a6594fd643f777f4.mp4?t=1781004851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI / Immersive Experience. </strong>No intrusive interface. Everything is integrated into the world: light, sound, and environment are your only tools. Even use your phone can kill you if It doesn't the right moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536740/extras/417cfef4e17204c47d89450ae57a47e5.avif?t=1781004851\" alt=\"Mobile widget view.\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in the middle of a desolate road, with no memory of who you are or how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your hand, a forgotten flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around you, whispers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some deceive you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some want something from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you choose to interact with these echoes will shape your fate. But first, you must endure a disturbing journey through a cursed place filled with secrets, darkness, and unsettling trials.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a first-person psychological horror experience where every choice matters. Confront the Echoes of a forgotten past and uncover the truth behind your lost identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror.</strong> The darkness hides Echoes of the past. As you explore, the environment itself tells a story, fragments of memories, whispers, and unsettling details that hint at what happened bef